    'For a domain that no longer resolves at all. Lower on purpose. A timeout is often a server having a bad minute, but a domain that has stopped resolving is nearly always a domain that is gone, and making you wait another day to hear about it helps nobody.' => 'For a domain that no longer resolves at all. Lower on purpose. A timeout is often a server having a bad minute, but a domain that has stopped resolving is nearly always a domain that is gone, and making you wait another day to hear about it helps nobody.',
